From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ole Algoritme <olealgoritme@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 15:36:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] wsi/win32: vendor NIS (MIT), CAS (MIT), SGSR 1
 (BSD-3-Clause) and xBR-lv2 (MIT)

NVIDIA Image Scaling SDK v1.0.3 (NIS_Scaler.h, NIS_Config.h), AMD
FidelityFX CAS 1.20190610 (ffx_cas.h), Snapdragon Game Super Resolution 1
(sgsr1_shader_mobile_edge_direction.frag) and Hyllian's xBR-lv2
(xbr-lv2-standalone.slang), unmodified, with their licences, for the
composed present's scalers.
